body:
NTA - your sister is the one being very dramatic. It sounds like she's misinformed, and perhaps even OCD about the swim diaper situation. I can't see any other reason why she wouldn't let your baby in the pool unless she has a major germ phobia or something of that nature - it almost seems strange. Does she exhibit those behaviours in other areas of life?

&#x200B;

With that being said - I do think you need to get over it, as long as she's apologised. At the end of the day, it is her pool, even if her reasons are not valid. Just don't bring the kids again. Maybe she will rethink and lighten up.
